title: "Tajima Ramen Menu | Six San Diego Rooms, Six Menus"
description: "Every Tajima room serves a different menu. Twenty dishes are on five or six of the six San Diego menus, including tonkotsu, the Tajima Red and karaage. Pick your room to see the rest."
